# FFmpeg shared libraries — NOT tracked in git.
# The server (whisper_server.py) looks for ffmpeg/bin next to itself.
# On first setup, run:  python get_ffmpeg.py
# This downloads the ~90 MB shared build (with avcodec/avformat/avutil DLLs
# that pyannote's torchcodec decoder requires) into ./ffmpeg/bin.
*.dll
*.exe
